  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 5.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne nelle, ðolige ure ealra freonscipes ⁊ ealles ðæs ðe he age.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he is not willing to do this, he shall forfeit the friendship of all of us, and all that he possesses.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne nelle, ðolige ure ealra freodscipes ⁊ ealles ðæs ðe he age.</ab>
      </div>
